2:T1211,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Service","name":"IPTV for Smart TV UK | Samsung, LG & Sony Setup Guide","serviceType":"IPTV for Smart TV","description":"IPTV on a Smart TV in the UK. Setup for Samsung Tizen and LG webOS, which app to use now Smart IPTV has gone from the Samsung store, MAC address activation, Sony and Philips sets, and buffering fixes. Free 24-hour trial.","url":"https://www.iptvuk.buzz/iptv-for-smart-tv-uk","provider":{"@type":"Organization","name":"IPTV UK","url":"https://www.iptvuk.buzz","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.iptvuk.buzz/icon.svg"}},"areaServed":{"@type":"Country","name":"United Kingdom"},"offers":[{"@type":"Offer","name":"Ultimate Plan","price":"49.99","priceCurrency":"GBP","url":"https://www.iptvuk.buzz/pricing","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock"},{"@type":"Offer","name":"Pro Plan","price":"34.99","priceCurrency":"GBP","url":"https://www.iptvuk.buzz/pricing","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock"},{"@type":"Offer","name":"Value Plan","price":"24.99","priceCurrency":"GBP","url":"https://www.iptvuk.buzz/pricing","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock"},{"@type":"Offer","name":"Starter Plan","price":"14.99","priceCurrency":"GBP","url":"https://www.iptvuk.buzz/pricing","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock"}]},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I watch IPTV on a Samsung Smart TV?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Samsung televisions from around 2017 onwards run Tizen and will run an IPTV player installed from the Smart Hub. Samsung removed the original Smart IPTV app from its UK store, so message us and we will tell you which player is currently listed and working for your model rather than sending you to an app that no longer exists."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which IPTV app should I use on an LG Smart TV?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"LG televisions running webOS 4.0 and above — broadly 2018 onwards — can install a suitable player straight from the LG Content Store, so there is nothing to sideload. We will confirm the current app for your model when you message us, because store listings change."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I need a Firestick if I have a Smart TV?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Not if your television is a recent Samsung or LG, or a Sony or Philips running Android TV — the player installs on the television itself. A Firestick is worth it for sets from before about 2016, where the app store often no longer carries a working player and the hardware struggles with large channel lists."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why does the app ask for a MAC address?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Smart TV players identify the television by its MAC address instead of a username and password, which saves you typing a long server address with a remote. You read the code off the screen, send it to us, and we load your playlist onto that device from our end."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Will IPTV work on my Sony or Philips TV?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, and more easily than on Samsung or LG. Sony, Philips, TCL and Hisense sets generally run Android TV or Google TV, so players install from the Google Play Store like a normal app. Our Android TV page covers those sets specifically."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I watch 4K on my Smart TV?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, where the channel is broadcast in 4K and your television supports it. You will want around 25 Mbps of steady broadband. A 4K stream on a 1080p television still plays, just downscaled."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"My TV is from 2015. Will it work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Possibly not. Older Tizen and webOS app stores frequently no longer list a working player, and older panels slow down badly with a few thousand channels loaded. A Firestick in the HDMI port is the cheaper and more reliable answer, and gives you exactly the same channel list."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I use the same subscription on my TV and my phone?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You can save your details on as many devices as you like. How many can play at the same time depends on the connection limit on your plan, so tell us how many screens you need and we will confirm what your plan allows."}}]},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.iptvuk.buzz"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"IPTV for Smart TV","item":"https://www.iptvuk.buzz/iptv-for-smart-tv-uk"}]}]}0:["gmjwm0ccykok87_eKU8cA",[[["",{"children":["iptv-for-smart-tv-uk",{"children":["__PAGE__",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":["iptv-for-smart-tv-uk",{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",["$","main",null,{"className":"bg-white text-slate-900","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],["$","$L3",null,{}],[["$","section",null,{"className":"relative overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 text-white","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_left,_rgba(249,115,22,0.28),_transparent_45%),radial-gradient(circle_at_bottom_right,_rgba(14,165,233,0.2),_transparent_45%)]"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"relative mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-20","children":[["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"Breadcrumb","className":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-400","children":[["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/","className":"transition hover:text-orange-300","children":"Home"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"mx-2 text-slate-600","children":"/"}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/installation-guide","className":"transition hover:text-orange-300","children":"Devices"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"mx-2 text-slate-600","children":"/"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-slate-300","children":"Smart TV"}]]}],["$","div