"className":"mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-orange-500","children":"Why the TV itself"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl","children":"Why run IPTV on the television rather than a streaming stick"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 max-w-3xl text-base leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"A Firestick is the right answer for an older television. If yours is a recent Samsung or LG, running the player natively is simpler and usually smoother."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2","children":[["$","article","One remote, one input",{"className":"rounded-[1.5rem] border border-slate-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-slate-50 p-6 shadow-[0_20px_60px_-45px_rgba(15,23,42,0.5)]","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900","children":"One remote, one input"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"No switching to HDMI 2, no second remote on the arm of the sofa, no household confusion about which box does what. Live TV sits alongside the apps you already use."}]]}],["$","article","The panel gets the full picture",{"className":"rounded-[1.5rem] border border-slate-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-slate-50 p-6 shadow-[0_20px_60px_-45px_rgba(15,23,42,0.5)]","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900","children":"The panel gets the full picture"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Playing on the television avoids a second decode-and-re-encode step through an external stick. On a 4K set with a 4K feed, native playback is the shorter path."}]]}],["$","article","Nothing extra to buy or power",{"className":"rounded-[1.5rem] border border-slate-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-slate-50 p-6 shadow-[0_20px_60px_-45px_rgba(15,23,42,0.5)]","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900","children":"Nothing extra to buy or power"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"No stick, no adapter, no extra plug behind the unit. If the television is already on your network, the setup cost is zero."}]]}],["$","article","Ethernet is usually already there",{"className":"rounded-[1.5rem] border border-slate-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-slate-50 p-6 shadow-[0_20px_60px_-45px_rgba(15,23,42,0.5)]","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900","children":"Ethernet is usually already there"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Most Smart TVs include a wired network port, which streaming sticks generally do not. For live sport on a busy home network that is worth more than any other single change."}]]}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"apps","className":"scroll-mt-24 bg-slate-950 py-14 text-white sm:py-20","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-orange-300","children":"Compatibility"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight sm:text-4xl","children":"Which Smart TVs work?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 max-w-3xl text-base leading-7 text-slate-300","children":"Almost any Smart TV sold in the UK from about 2017 onwards will run an IPTV player. What changes between brands is which app you use and how it is installed."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-white/10","children":["$","table",null,{"className":"w-full min-w-[640px] border-collapse text-left text-sm","children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"className":"bg-white/10","children":[["$","th","Television",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white","children":"Te