all with nothing to sideload. webOS 4.0 and above gets the full feature set."}]]}],["$","tr","Sony, Philips, TCL, Hisense",{"className":"bg-white/[0.03]","children":[["$","td","Sony, Philips, TCL, Hisense-0",{"className":"border-t border-white/10 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 font-semibold text-white","children":"Sony, Philips, TCL, Hisense"}],["$","td","Sony, Philips, TCL, Hisense-1",{"className":"border-t border-white/10 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-300","children":"Android/Google TV"}],["$","td","Sony, Philips, TCL, Hisense-2",{"className":"border-t border-white/10 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-300","children":"Best of the lot"}],["$","td","Sony, Philips, TCL, Hisense-3",{"className":"border-t border-white/10 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-300","children":"These are Android TVs in a television case, so players install from the Play Store. Follow our Android TV guide rather than this page."}]]}],["$","tr","Samsung and LG before 2016",{"className":"","children":[["$","td","Samsung and LG before 2016-0",{"className":"border-t border-white/10 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 font-semibold text-white","children":"Samsung and LG before 2016"}],["$","td","Samsung and LG before 2016-1",{"className":"border-t border-white/10 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-300","children":"Legacy Tizen/webOS"}],["$","td","Samsung and LG before 2016-2",{"className":"border-t border-white/10 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-300","children":"Hit and miss"}],["$","td","Samsung and LG before 2016-3",{"className":"border-t border-white/10 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-300","children":"Older app stores often no longer carry a working player, and the hardware struggles with large channel lists. A Firestick plugged into the same set is the cheaper fix."}]]}],["$","tr","Panasonic, Toshiba, Sharp",{"className":"bg-white/[0.03]","children":[["$","td","Panasonic, Toshiba, Sharp-0",{"className":"border-t border-white/10 px-4 py-3 align-top leadi