 Wi-Fi and Ethernet can present a different MAC address, and your playlist is tied to the old one. Send us the new MAC address and we will move your subscription across."}]]}],["$","article","Buffering on Wi-Fi only",{"className":"rounded-[1.5rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-xs font-bold text-white","children":3}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base font-bold text-slate-900","children":"Buffering on Wi-Fi only"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Televisions often have weaker aerials than a phone sitting next to them. Move to the 5 GHz band, or run an Ethernet cable to the port on the back. This is the single most effective fix for live sport."}]]}],["$","article","The programme guide is empty",{"className":"rounded-[1.5rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-xs font-bold text-white","children":4}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base font-bold text-slate-900","children":"The programme guide is empty"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"The EPG imports separately from the channel list and takes a few minutes on first load. If it is still empty after ten minutes, close the app fully — not just back to the home screen — and reopen it."}]]}],["$","article","Menus have become sluggish",{"className":"rounded-[1.5rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-xs font-bold text-white","children":5}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base font-bold text-slate-900","children":"Menus have become sluggish"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Guide data builds up over weeks. Clear the app cache in your television’s app settings, or remove and reinstall the player. Reinstalling does not lose your subscription, because that is held against your MAC address at our end."}]]}],["$","article","One channel fails, everything else is fine",{"className":"rounded-[1.5rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-xs font-bold text-white","children":6}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base font-bold text-slate-900","children":"One channel fails, everything else is fine"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"That is the source, not your television. Send us the channel name rather than reinstalling anything."}]]}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"faq","className":"scroll-mt-24 bg-white py-14 sm:py-20","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl","children":"IPTV on Smart TV: frequently asked questions"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 space-y-3","children":[["$","details","Can I watch IPTV on a Samsung Smart TV?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Can I watch IPTV on a Samsung Smart TV?"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-lg text-slate-400 transition group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Yes. Samsung televisions from around 2017 onwards run Tizen and will run an IPTV player installed from the Smart Hub. Samsung removed the original Smart IPTV app from its UK store, so message us and we will tell you which player is currently listed and working for your model rather than sending you to an app that no longer exists."}]]}],["$","details","Which IPTV app should I use on an LG Smart TV?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Which IPTV app should I use on an LG Smart TV?"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-lg text-slate-400 transition group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"LG televisions running webOS 4.0 and above — broadly 2018 onwards — can install a suitable player straight from the LG Content Store, so there is nothing to sideload. We will confirm the current app for your model when you message us, because store listings change."}]]}],["$","details","Do I need a Firestick if I have a Smart TV?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Do I need a Firestick if I have a Smart TV?"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-lg text-slate-400 transition group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Not if your television is a recent Samsung or LG, or a Sony or Philips running Android TV — the player installs on the television itself. A Firestick is worth it for sets from before about 2016, where the app store often no longer carries a working player and the hardware struggles with large channel lists."}]]}],["$","details","Why does the app ask for a MAC address?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Why does the app ask for a MAC address?"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-lg text-slate-400 transition group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Smart TV players identify the television by its MAC address instead of a username and password, which saves you typing a long server address with a remote. You read the code off the screen, send it to us, and we load your playlist onto that device from our end."}]]}],["$","details","Will IPTV work on my Sony or Philips TV?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Will IPTV work on my Sony or Philips TV?"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-lg text-slate-400 transition group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Yes, and more easily than on Samsung or LG. Sony, Philips, TCL and Hisense sets generally run Android TV or Google TV, so players install from the Google Play Store like a normal app. Our Android TV page covers those sets specifically."}]]}],["$","details","Can I watch 4K on my Smart TV?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Can I watch 4K on my